          "fix": "Make the URL decide the view instead of localStorage.\n1. Replace lines 435–436 with: var v = /[?&]view=team/.test(location.search) ? 'team' : 'customer';\n2. In JWC.setView, replace JWC.store.set('view:' + state.n, v); with: try { var u = new URL(location.href); if (v === 'team') u.searchParams.set('view', 'team'); else u.searchParams.delete('view'); history.replaceState(null, '', u); } catch (e) {}\nA reload then keeps the current view, but plain links always open the customer page.",
