his itself and says the claim must be blocked.\n- **Medium:**\n  - Numbers left over from before the CFO pass contradict each other (churn, subscriber counts, Pro Partner and Gift Studio inputs, Butcher Club tier prices on the $1M page).\n  - The $1M path total shows as $1.2M, $1.3M and $1.6M on the same page.\n  - The co-owner is called Stavros, Steven and Steve.\n  - Headcount is given as 10–18 in some places and 15–25 in others.\n  - Internal file names and code variables show in client copy (model-assumptions.md, play-0N.md \"corrected\", \"hence marginPct 20\", \"startMonth 2\").\n  - The embedded research docs leak local /Users/erwingarcia paths, front-end build specs and a \"Weak spots to exploit\" heading.\n  - Customer-facing copy names Tasia and Lucas (known only from customer reviews) and commits them to roles.\n  - Reheating times are invented.\n  - The Team Fuel jerky is described as \"in development\".\n  - F+/C− grades sit on ideas the plan recommends.\n- **Low:** the 10x headline, spelling and typos, and smaller inconsistencies.",
