          "fix": "Remove the letter badge. In million.html:174 render the score and a plain verdict instead, e.g. '<span class=\"grade\">86<small>/100</small></span>' plus a word: 80+ 'Strongest', 70–79 'Strong', 60–69 'Worth a test', 50–59 'Later', under 50 'Not now'. For the three ideas on the path, add a 'Start: Nov 2026 / Dec 2026 / Jan 2027' tag so timing, not grade, explains the order.",
