          "evidence": "agents.html:60-63: <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full\">... <th class=\"... text-right\">Multiple</th>. In the 390px screenshot the header shows only LEVER, TODAY (EST.), WITH AGENTS.",
          "fix": "Below 768px, render each lever as a card instead of a table row: the title line '<b>Conversations per staff hour</b> <span class=\"badge\">7x</span>', then one line 'Today: about 8 → With agents: about 55', with the explanation and agent links under it in a <details> 'Why'. Or at minimum move 'Multiple' to the second column and add a 'Swipe →' hint.",
